/// and inherits <c>currentColor</c> for monochrome marks so the consumer's
/// <c>--visuauth-text</c> custom property re-paints them. The handful of
/// brand-coloured marks (Microsoft, Google, Discord, Slack, Spotify, etc.)
/// hardcode their official palette because flattening them to one colour
